  "createdAt": "2026-10-14T16:26:00.359853Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-14T16:40:29.171109Z",
  "totalBlocks": 24,
  "translatedBlocks": 24,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "633b5c4b9b96c5d2",
      "translationZh": "简而言之：对 11 个编程基准排行榜，按参评规模将排名归一化为百分位，按基准家族去重，并综合代码仓库、智能体、实时编程和函数生成任务的结果。当前快照涵盖 98 个模型系列和 268 条证据记录。我正在寻找遗漏的排行榜，以及更适合评估本地部署的指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d74c3208b8713221",
      "translationZh": "大家好，r/LocalLLaMA——我是 LLMLearner 的开发者之一。我一直在尝试回答“最好的编程 LLM 是什么？”，而不是把某一个基准当作绝对真值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9e7bb5a81ce60c7",
      "translationZh": "当前快照涵盖 98 个模型系列的代表模型、11 个符合条件的基准排行榜，以及 268 条去重后的模型–基准测试结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4bc8eb15d21b5d30",
      "translationZh": "将证据划分为代码仓库工程、智能体编程/工具使用、实时编程和函数生成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b2c6b73d810037a2",
      "translationZh": "不要对不兼容的原始指标取平均值。将每条记录中的排名转换为基于参评规模的百分位：1 − (排名 − 1) / (参评规模 − 1)。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "610c55477898ee64",
      "translationZh": "对重叠的结果去重。例如，HumanEval pass@1/pass@10/pass@100 不能算作三张独立的选票。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5204c19e8d9241be",
      "translationZh": "在综合推荐中，目前赋予代码仓库工程 40%、智能体编程 35%、实时编程 20%、函数生成 5% 的权重。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7ef83a25032ba6db",
      "translationZh": "缺失的证据不按零处理。对已有证据对应的权重重新归一化，同时用单独的覆盖度标签说明每项结果获得证据支持的充分程度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4d5af23c7be431d1",
      "translationZh": "价格、上下文长度、权重开放状态和生命周期状态均与能力评分分开处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99822ebecf941be9",
      "translationZh": "当前采用的输入包括 SWE-bench Verified、SWE-bench Pro、SWE-bench Multilingual、LiveCodeBench、Codeforces、HumanEval、MBPP、DeepSWE 和 GSO。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8027cb921a36836",
      "translationZh": "我所了解的一些局限性：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6b2a2487056b990c",
      "translationZh": "排名百分位掩盖了分数差异的大小，并且取决于参与评估的模型群体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "498ef133043ad167",
      "translationZh": "基准测试的选择、分组和权重均由编者决定。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1916bdee4a2c43f4",
      "translationZh": "智能体式评测的分数包含模型及其评测框架、工具和辅助支撑机制的表现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "93f63e21b13c91c2",
      "translationZh": "公开基准测试可能受到数据污染，或被过度针对性优化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "05953bcc4188030a",
      "translationZh": "新模型和权重开放模型的评测覆盖往往不均衡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c81162cbd79e44c2",
      "translationZh": "每个模型系列只选择一个代表，可能会掩盖不同变体之间的重要差异。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94d128775141461e",
      "translationZh": "指南在这里：https://llmlearner.com/best-llms/coding",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "717f01a775929c13",
      "translationZh": "我尤其希望收到关于以下问题的反馈：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dc5523f08c34abc8",
      "translationZh": "应该添加或替换哪些编程排行榜或评测？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "02d41e0f858c1af1",
      "translationZh": "哪些基准测试由于评测框架差异过大，不应合并？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "11a327ae0408b72c",
      "translationZh": "本地部署方面的证据——量化、VRAM、吞吐量以及长上下文可靠性——是否应该成为一个独立的排名维度？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "691f32bbf6f57d9d",
      "translationZh": "利益关系披露：我与 LLMLearner 有关联。英语不是我的母语，我使用了 AI 来帮助翻译和润色这篇帖子。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e631af6ded20f5e",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/DataLearnerAI 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
